10468                                          directory search. 
10469                                          on entry: FNAME/DRVNUM has the filename to search for in directory
10470                                                    dir sectors are settled in track 0, sector 4 up to end of track
10471                                          on exit: if fname found in dir -> A=0, 
10472                                                   DIRPTR has the addr of current dir entry of found FNAME
10473                                                   DRVSEC has the unit/sector of dir sector of found FNAME 
10474                                                   not found -> A<>0
10475                                          
10476  
10477                                          dir entry layout: bytes 0..4 fname
10478                                                                  5    attribute	00=regular file, 80=deleted file
10479                                                                  6    start track 0..76
10480                                                                  7    start sector 1..26
10481                                                                  8,9  file length (in sectors) (8=MSB, 9=LSB)
10482                                                                  10   not used
