11137  09CC CE 0115          LDX     #CMDLIN   Command Line buffer address
11138  09CF FF 0165          STX     CMDINI    stores the addr of 1st char in command line buffer to be processed
11139  09D2 BD 03BE          JSR     GETFNAM   Get next param ("RENAME") in command line into FNAME/DRVNUM variables
11140  09D5 BD 03BE          JSR     GETFNAM   Get next param (OldName) in command line into FNAME/DRVNUM variables
