11144  09DE 7E 0790  L09DE   JMP     ERNOFIL   Print error "NO FILE", return to command prompt
11145   ;
11146  09E1 BD 03BE  L09E1   JSR     GETFNAM   Get next param (NewName) in command line into FNAME/DRVNUM variables
11147  09E4 FE 0177          LDX     DIRPTR    get addr current dir entry (points to OldFile)
